3. **Set environment variable:**
   ```bash
   # Windows (PowerShell)
   $env:AZURE_APP_CONFIG_CONNECTION_STRING="your-connection-string"

   # Linux/Mac
   export AZURE_APP_CONFIG_CONNECTION_STRING="your-connection-string"
   ```

